# T12-O-M1 覆层端到端：impl overlay for int 覆层 __to_prompt__，with overlay 块内生效、块外恢复原生（经行为插值渲染观测）
# doc: docs/syntax/06_oop.md 覆层章节 + docs/architecture/04_vm_interpreter.md §2
# expect-class: PASS
# expect-out: [MOCK] report: overlayed-int | [MOCK] report: 5 | DONE
# expect-exit: 0
# expect-llm: false
import ai
ai.set_mock_mode()
impl overlay for int:
    func __to_prompt__(self) -> str:
        return "overlayed-int"
int x = 5
with overlay(int.__to_prompt__):
    str inside = @~ report: $x ~
    print(inside)
str outside = @~ report: $x ~
print(outside)
print("DONE")
